  "prefLabel": "Ph 901.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 901.01 Scope. The provisions of this chapter shall apply to, and impose duties upon, all mail-order pharmacies holding registrations issued by the board.\n\nSource. #7474, eff 4-5-01; ss by #9341, eff 12-4-08; ss by #10663, eff 9-3-14; ss by #13244, eff 7-30-21",
